            "paragraph": "The state-of-the-art atmospheric model Mod\u00e8le Atmosph\u00e9rique R\u00e9gional version 3.14 (MAR v3.14) was used with a spatial resolution of 10 km is daily resolution57. MAR v3.14 was forced with 6-hourly ERA 5 reanalysis data58 to simulate meltwater production. MARv3.14 simulates melt by solving the prognostic meteorological equations and a cloud microphysical model, coupled with the Soil Ice Snow Vegetation Atmosphere Transfer (SISVAT) model 57,59. MAR has been extensively validated over the GrIS against satellite derived melts and meteorological observations31,42,57,60. The variable analyzed here is meltwater production, simulated using the SISVAT module of MAR v3.14 coupled with the CROCUS model 61.",
